      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-chevaliertw/ru/about-categories/our-vision/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Основополагающие убеждения и стремления 
    &lt;div id=&#34;основополагающие-убеждения-и-стремления&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#%d0%be%d1%81%d0%bd%d0%be%d0%b2%d0%be%d0%bf%d0%be%d0%bb%d0%b0%d0%b3%d0%b0%d1%8e%d1%89%d0%b8%d0%b5-%d1%83%d0%b1%d0%b5%d0%b6%d0%b4%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%b8%d1%8f-%d0%b8-%d1%81%d1%82%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%bc%d0%bb%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%b8%d1%8f&#34; aria-label=&#34;Якорь&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
